{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Kee4fRmzK51794799401.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名73歲婦人早上在薄扶林置富花園外過馬路時，被客貨車撞倒，昏迷送院搶救。司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。<br/></p><p>事發後地上遺下拖鞋及雜物，警方圍封涉事客貨車調查，期間需要單線雙程行車。</p><p></p><p>事發在早上8時許，一名73歲婦人在置富南區廣場斑馬線橫過馬路期間，被客貨車撞倒，昏迷送往瑪麗醫院。警方以涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害，拘捕36歲客貨車男司機，正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:52:38.148208+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:40.306200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:46:01.470314+00:00","content_hash":"5e8cdcca0a3609b05eabac11d1a8b3d387f5f56ed0a5687ea4f49d14e2e1a855","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:52:38.148208+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}